Troubleshooting Tips
Issue: Permission denied when capturing packets

Solution: Ensure user is in wireshark group: sudo usermod -a -G wireshark $USER and log out/in
Issue: Scapy cannot read PCAP file

Solution: Check file path and permissions: ls -la /tmp/capture1.pcap
Issue: Zeek not found after installation

Solution: Source bashrc or add to PATH: export PATH=/opt/zeek/bin:$PATH
Issue: No packets captured

Solution: Verify network interface: ip link show and use correct interface name
